## Frontend configuration
## Copy to `.env` for local dev.

# CRA dev server port (backend uses 3000)
PORT=3001

# Landing countdown target (ISO with offset). Default: 31 May 2026, 1:00 PM IST.
# REACT_APP_EVENT_ISO=2026-05-31T13:00:00+05:30

# Override default bundled background (`public/landing-bg.png`).
# REACT_APP_LANDING_BG_URL=

